  "body": "The [create a notification](https://notifications.spec.whatwg.org/#create-a-notification) algorithm, step 7 says\r\n\r\n> Set _notification_’s title to _options_’s `title`.\r\n\r\nI think this should say:\r\n\r\n> Set _notification_’s title to `title`.\r\n\r\n(_title_ is not used elsewhere in the algorithm, and [NotificationOptions](https://notifications.spec.whatwg.org/#dictdef-notificationoptions) doesn’t have a title.)",
